   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)<br>\n<strong>Enhances:</strong> Sandevistan<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p>Enhances a Sandevistan. When a perceived hostile within 6m/yds activates Speedware, or has Speedware active when initiative is rolled, the user may activate their Sandevistan without an Action. Doing so raises its initiative bonus by 2 (+5 total) but the duration is only 9 seconds (3 Rounds), and an SOS-triggered Sandevistan has triple the usual cooldown.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Change the Sandevistan's initiative effect to +5 by hand when it fires through SOS.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Neuralware).</em></p>"
